I didn't know what else to do.

1020
01:03:45,989 --> 01:03:47,150
How could you do that?

1021
01:03:47,324 --> 01:03:48,485
I don't know, uh, uh...

1022
01:03:48,658 --> 01:03:50,957
But when I told Sam,
he was furious. He...

1023
