Oh, no. Oh, no.

1057
01:05:57,287 --> 01:05:58,721
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

1058
01:05:58,888 --> 01:05:59,912
Let me help you out.

1059
01:06:00,089 --> 01:06:01,569
Let me help you out.
- All right.

1060
01:06:04,060 --> 01:06:05,153
Okay. Let me just...

1061
