Look, I'm fine. I'm
fine. Thank you.

1063
01:06:09,532 --> 01:06:10,898
Thank you.

1064
01:06:35,725 --> 01:06:37,325
<i>- Operator.</i>
- Yes. Hello.

1065
01:06:37,494 --> 01:06:39,861
Yes. I need to call the
U.S.A. Atlanta, Georgia.

1066
01:06:40,029 --> 01:06:42,260
<i>- One moment.</i>
- Right.

1067
01:06:42,765 --> 01:06:45,565
<i>Well, uh, I'll bet they
