01:14:00,503 --> 01:14:04,069
<i>In the pines In the
pines, in the pines</i>

1167
01:14:04,240 --> 01:14:06,573
<i>Where the sun never shines</i>

1168
01:14:06,742 --> 01:14:10,179
<i>Gonna shiver When
