01:14:22,224 --> 01:14:25,717
<i>Through the field of
clover We will ride to Dover</i>

1173
01:14:25,895 --> 01:14:29,059
<i>On our golden wedding day</i>

1174
01:14:29,231 --> 01:14:31,231
<i>- Put on your old grey bonnet</i>
BRONSON: Mr. Matlock.

